>> title: Taco Seasoning
>> category: Spice Blends & Marinades
>> tags: tex-mex, chiles, spice blend, no-cook, pantry
>> servings: 16
>> time: 10 min
>> step.1: whisk together
>> step.2: whisk in
>> step.3: stir in

Whisk @chili powder{1/4%cup}(28 g), @ground cumin{2%Tbs}, and @smoked paprika{1%Tbs} together in a #bowl{}.

Whisk @garlic powder{1%Tbs}, @onion powder{1%Tbs}, and @dried Mexican oregano{2%tsp} into @&(~1)chile base{}.

Stir @kosher salt{1%Tbs}, @black pepper{1%tsp}, @cayenne{1/2%tsp}, and @cornstarch{1%Tbs} into @&(~1)mixture{}.
